WEBVTT

00:07.724 --> 00:09.000
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.068 --> 00:10.689
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.758 --> 00:12.172
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.241 --> 00:14.137
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.206 --> 00:17.206
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.275 --> 00:19.275
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.344 --> 00:21.275
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.344 --> 00:23.172
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.241 --> 00:24.931
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.000 --> 00:27.310
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.379 --> 00:29.413
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.482 --> 00:31.241
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.310 --> 00:33.275
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.344 --> 00:35.137
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.206 --> 00:37.275
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.344 --> 00:39.413
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.482 --> 00:40.724
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.793 --> 00:42.586
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.655 --> 00:45.344
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.413 --> 00:47.620
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.689 --> 00:49.172
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.689 --> 00:53.620
[mellow music]
[柔和的音乐]

00:53.689 --> 01:00.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.827 --> 01:05.379
- You're just filthy trash.
Get in the bag!
- 你就是个肮脏的垃圾。
快进包里吧！

01:05.448 --> 01:07.758
- [laughter]
- Filthy trash!
- [笑声]
- 肮脏的垃圾！

01:07.827 --> 01:09.862
Gah! Trash juice!
嘎！垃圾果汁！

01:09.931 --> 01:12.758
- Hey, uh, maybe we should use
another garbage bag, Mr. Krabs.
- 嘿，呃，也许我们应该使用
另一个垃圾袋，蟹老板。

01:12.827 --> 01:13.965
This one's kinda full.
这个有点满了

01:14.034 --> 01:15.310
- Forget it, boy-o.
-算了，小伙子。

01:15.379 --> 01:17.344
I'm not paying
for another garbage bag.
我不付钱
另一个垃圾袋。

01:17.413 --> 01:19.793
Just put your back into it.
只要把你的背放进去就可以了。

01:19.862 --> 01:20.965
- Back, eh?
- 回来了，嗯？

01:21.034 --> 01:22.379
Like this?
像这样？

01:22.448 --> 01:25.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:27.344 --> 01:30.137
- Oh,
let me help you with that.
- 哦，
让我帮你吧。

01:30.206 --> 01:33.793
[grunting heavily]
[重重地咕哝]

01:33.862 --> 01:35.655
[squeaking noises]
[吱吱声]

01:35.724 --> 01:36.965
- [laughter]
- [笑声]

01:37.034 --> 01:38.896
Let me try.
让我试试。

01:38.965 --> 01:40.413
[strains]
[菌株]

01:42.931 --> 01:44.862
Whee!
哎哟！

01:44.931 --> 01:47.344
- Keep it up! It's working!
- 继续努力吧！它正在工作！

01:47.413 --> 01:48.344
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

01:48.413 --> 01:50.689
- Keeping it up, Mr. Krabs.
- 坚持下去，蟹老板。

01:50.758 --> 01:51.689
Ha-yah!
哈耶！

01:51.758 --> 01:52.862
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

01:52.931 --> 01:54.482
[trash clanking]
[垃圾叮当作响]

01:54.551 --> 01:58.275
- [sipping]
[low rumbling]
- [啜饮]
[低沉的隆隆声]

02:01.000 --> 02:02.068
[crashes]
[崩溃]

02:02.137 --> 02:05.068
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

02:05.137 --> 02:07.137
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:07.206 --> 02:09.103
[sirens wailing]
[警笛哀嚎]

02:09.172 --> 02:12.103
[suspenseful,
exciting music]
【悬疑，
激动人心的音乐]

02:12.172 --> 02:15.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:15.344 --> 02:17.034
- [sigh]
- Come in, base.
- [叹气]
- 进来吧，基地。

02:17.103 --> 02:18.965
We found the trash flingers.
我们发现了垃圾扔者。

02:19.034 --> 02:21.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:21.758 --> 02:24.793
- Ow. Ung? Ugh. Ow.
- 噢。翁？啊。噢。

02:24.862 --> 02:25.793
- Mm-hmm.
- 嗯嗯。

02:25.862 --> 02:26.793
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

02:26.862 --> 02:29.000
[tongue smacking]
[咂舌]

02:29.068 --> 02:30.413
Just as I thought.
正如我所想的那样。

02:30.482 --> 02:32.068
Trying to save money
on trash bags.
努力省钱
垃圾袋上。

02:32.137 --> 02:34.206
- I don't know
what you're talking about, sir.
- 我不知道
你在说什么，先生。

02:34.275 --> 02:37.172
- You call us Trash Inspector,
not sir!
- 你称我们为垃圾检查员，
不是先生！

02:37.241 --> 02:39.896
We didn't go to
garbage school for nothing!
我们没有去
垃圾学校一无所获！

02:39.965 --> 02:41.310
both: Go Fighting Filthies!
两人：去对抗肮脏的人吧！

02:41.379 --> 02:43.310
- Whatever you say,
inspector.
- 不管你说什么，
检查员。

02:43.379 --> 02:46.344
- What I say is...
- 我说的是...

02:46.413 --> 02:48.068
You have been found guilty
你已被判有罪

02:48.137 --> 02:50.793
of willful cheapskatery
and flagrant trash flinging.
故意小气的
以及公然乱扔垃圾。

02:50.862 --> 02:53.344
- Your sentence is to
collect all the garbage
- 你的判决是
收集所有垃圾

02:53.413 --> 02:56.586
in Bikini Bottom using that.
在比基尼泳裤中使用它。

02:57.758 --> 02:59.758
[music stops]
[音乐停止]

02:59.827 --> 03:00.827
Uh...
呃...

03:00.896 --> 03:02.586
that one.
那个。

03:02.655 --> 03:04.482
[car farting]
[汽车放屁]

03:04.551 --> 03:05.620
[crashes]
[崩溃]

03:05.689 --> 03:08.413
- Whatever you say,
inspectorers.
- 不管你说什么，
检查员。

03:08.482 --> 03:10.034
[radio buzzes]
- All units...
[无线电嗡嗡声]
- 所有单位...

03:10.103 --> 03:12.379
Code 3-4-2 reported
near Bikini Flats.
已报告代码 3-4-2
靠近比基尼平底鞋。

03:12.448 --> 03:14.620
- Someone's not separating
their recycling.
- 有人没有分开
他们的回收。

03:14.689 --> 03:15.655
Let's ride!
我们骑吧！

03:15.724 --> 03:17.275
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:17.344 --> 03:18.620
[tires screech,
siren wailing]
[轮胎的尖叫声，
警笛哀嚎]

03:18.689 --> 03:20.310
- All right,
you heard the inspectors.
- 好吧，
你听到了检查员的声音。

03:20.379 --> 03:22.068
Get to picking up that trash!
快去捡那些垃圾吧！

03:22.137 --> 03:24.448
- But it was your punishment.
- 但这是对你的惩罚。

03:24.517 --> 03:27.103
- I like to think of it
as our punishment.
- 我喜欢想它
作为我们的惩罚。

03:27.172 --> 03:29.965
And by ours,
I mean yours!
而我们的，
我是说你的！

03:30.034 --> 03:31.172
Now get going!
现在开始吧！

03:31.241 --> 03:33.068
- I'm gonna do what you said,
- 我会照你说的去做

03:33.137 --> 03:34.758
but you should know
I resent it!
但你应该知道
我很反感！

03:34.827 --> 03:36.758
- I'm cool with that.
- 我对此很满意。

03:36.827 --> 03:39.896
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

03:41.758 --> 03:43.689
[engine whirrs]
[引擎轰鸣声]

03:43.758 --> 03:46.793
- [wacky laughing]
- [古怪的笑声]

03:49.172 --> 03:51.172
Aha!
啊哈！

03:51.241 --> 03:52.172
[metal clankering]
[金属叮当声]

03:52.241 --> 03:53.689
Uh-huh!
嗯嗯！

03:55.137 --> 03:56.482
Hoo. Huh!
呼。哈！

03:57.172 --> 03:58.586
Yo!
哟！

03:58.655 --> 04:00.172
That was a close one.
[nervous laugh]
那是一场很接近的比赛。
[紧张的笑声]

04:00.241 --> 04:01.931
See you later, little guy.
稍后见，小家伙。

04:02.000 --> 04:04.344
- Stupid, smelly garbage truck.
- 又蠢又臭的垃圾车。

04:04.413 --> 04:06.758
[blubbering]
[哭泣]

04:06.827 --> 04:07.793
- Hey, Squidward!
- 嘿，章鱼哥！

04:07.862 --> 04:08.793
- [shrieks]
- [尖叫]

04:08.862 --> 04:10.137
- Whee!
- 呼！

04:10.206 --> 04:12.448
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

04:12.517 --> 04:15.379
Oh, all this fresh air
feels great in my holes.
哦，这新鲜的空气
在我的洞里感觉很棒。

04:15.448 --> 04:18.172
[flute-like whistling]
[笛子般的口哨声]

04:18.241 --> 04:19.172
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

04:19.241 --> 04:20.586
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

04:20.655 --> 04:22.724
- It's my turn
to ride on the back!
- 轮到我了
骑在后面！

04:24.310 --> 04:28.344
- [giggling]
It's all yours!
- [咯咯笑]
都是你的了！

04:28.413 --> 04:31.103
[exciting ukulele music]
【激动人心的尤克里里音乐】

04:31.172 --> 04:33.137
- Hey, this is kinda nice.
- 嘿，这有点不错。

04:33.206 --> 04:34.793
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

04:34.862 --> 04:37.137
[yelping]
[尖叫]

04:37.206 --> 04:40.379
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

04:41.448 --> 04:43.241
SpongeBob,
watch where you're driving!
海绵宝宝，
看看你在哪里开车！

04:43.310 --> 04:44.551
- I'm not driving,
Squidward!
- 我没有开车，
章鱼哥！

04:44.620 --> 04:46.275
You know
I don't have a license.
你知道
我没有执照。

04:46.344 --> 04:52.551
[yelping]
[tires screeching]
[尖叫]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

04:52.620 --> 04:53.931
- [impressed whistle]
- [感动的口哨]

04:54.000 --> 04:55.103
- You ready for a test drive?
- 你准备好试驾了吗？

04:55.172 --> 04:57.034
[crashes]
- [screaming]
[崩溃]
- [尖叫]

04:57.103 --> 04:59.137
- No problem,
we'll try this one.
- 没问题，
我们来试试这个。

04:59.206 --> 05:01.310
[crashes]
- [screaming]
[崩溃]
- [尖叫]

05:01.379 --> 05:03.827
- Not to worry,
we got plenty of--whoa!
- 不用担心，
我们有很多——哇！

05:03.896 --> 05:05.413
- [distant screaming]
- [远处的尖叫声]

05:05.482 --> 05:07.241
[metal booming]
[金属轰鸣]

05:07.310 --> 05:09.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:09.379 --> 05:11.620
[hacking]
[黑客攻击]

05:13.379 --> 05:14.586
[yelping]
[尖叫]

05:15.620 --> 05:19.034
[crashes]
[tires screeching]
[崩溃]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

05:19.103 --> 05:20.931
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

05:21.000 --> 05:22.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:22.655 --> 05:24.724
Ah-choo!
啊呼！

05:24.793 --> 05:25.827
Ugh!
啊!

05:27.034 --> 05:28.517
- Wasn't that fun?
- 那不是很有趣吗？

05:28.586 --> 05:31.724
- No! Just get me out
of this filth heap!
- 不！把我赶出去
这堆肮脏的东西！

05:31.793 --> 05:33.517
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:33.586 --> 05:36.931
- Ugh, look at me,
I'm a disgusting mess.
- 呃，看着我，
我是一个令人厌恶的混乱。

05:37.000 --> 05:38.551
- Oh, here.
- 哦，在这里。

05:38.620 --> 05:40.275
Try this hand sanitizer.
试试这款洗手液。

05:40.344 --> 05:41.310
- No, no, no,
wait, wait, wait,
- 不，不，不，
等等，等等，等等，

05:41.379 --> 05:42.310
don't--no, no!
不要——不，不！

05:42.379 --> 05:45.551
- [blows raspberry]
- [吹覆盆子]

05:45.620 --> 05:47.965
- I wish you would--
oh, hey, that's not too bad.
- 我希望你会--
哦，嘿，那还不错。

05:48.034 --> 05:49.758
[happy sigh]
[幸福的叹息]

05:49.827 --> 05:51.482
Well, now let's get
all this nasty trash
好吧，现在让我们得到
所有这些讨厌的垃圾

05:51.551 --> 05:53.379
in the truck
and get out of here.
在卡车里
然后离开这里。

05:53.448 --> 05:55.206
Ew, ew, ew, ew.
呃，呃，呃，呃。

05:55.275 --> 05:56.689
Ew!
呃！

05:56.758 --> 05:57.758
- Hah!
- 哈！

05:57.827 --> 05:59.068
- Oh! Watch it!
- 哦！注意！

05:59.137 --> 06:00.586
- Sorry, Squidward.
- 对不起，章鱼哥。

06:00.655 --> 06:02.344
Hm--ooh!
嗯——哦！

06:02.413 --> 06:06.000
Oh ho!
What a cute little dolly.
哦嗬！
多么可爱的小娃娃啊。

06:06.068 --> 06:09.482
He can be our truck mascot
and ride with us in the cab.
他可以成为我们的卡车吉祥物
和我们一起坐出租车。

06:09.551 --> 06:11.172
- Oh, great idea.
- 哦，好主意。

06:11.241 --> 06:12.655
Why don't I put him up front
我为什么不把他放在前面

06:12.724 --> 06:15.172
while you pick up
the rest of the trash?
当你拿起时
剩下的垃圾呢？

06:15.241 --> 06:16.448
- Thank you, Squidward.
- 谢谢你，章鱼哥。

06:16.517 --> 06:19.103
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

06:19.172 --> 06:20.448
[sighs]
[叹气]

06:20.517 --> 06:22.551
- I wanna have fun.
- 我想玩得开心。

06:23.310 --> 06:24.724
- Huh?
- 啊？

06:25.655 --> 06:28.000
- I wanna get good grades.
- 我想取得好成绩。

06:28.068 --> 06:32.344
- Well, you should
stop saying wanna, then.
- 嗯，你应该
那就别再说想要了。

06:32.413 --> 06:35.965
- I wanna destroy you.
- 我想毁掉你。

06:36.482 --> 06:37.862
- What the--
[shrieks]
- 什么是--
[尖叫声]

06:37.931 --> 06:40.965
[panicked shrieking]
[惊慌尖叫]

06:43.896 --> 06:45.965
- [yelping]
- [尖叫]

06:47.344 --> 06:49.517
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

06:49.586 --> 06:51.793
- That doll's possessed!
- 那个娃娃被附身了！

06:51.862 --> 06:55.896
- [laughter]
- [笑声]

06:55.965 --> 06:57.310
That was so fun!
太有趣了！

06:57.379 --> 06:59.896
You gotta try it.
- Forget it, you nitwit!
你一定要尝试一下。
-算了，你这个白痴！

06:59.965 --> 07:03.275
There's no way I'm getting in
the back of that filth wagon!
我根本进不去
那辆肮脏的马车的后面！

07:03.344 --> 07:04.413
[screams]
[尖叫声]

07:04.482 --> 07:06.551
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:06.620 --> 07:10.310
Oh, my internal organs!
哦，我的内脏！

07:10.379 --> 07:12.241
- [giggle]
Hey, look.
- [咯咯笑]
嘿，看。

07:12.310 --> 07:13.965
We fit!
我们适合！

07:14.034 --> 07:15.206
[laughter]
[笑声]

07:15.275 --> 07:16.689
Isn't this cozy?
这不是很温馨吗？

07:16.758 --> 07:19.517
- Please let
this nightmare end.
- 请让
这场噩梦结束了。

07:20.310 --> 07:21.448
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

07:21.517 --> 07:24.448
[machine whirring]
[机器呼呼地响]

07:24.517 --> 07:28.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:28.379 --> 07:31.344
- [yelping]
- [尖叫]

07:31.413 --> 07:33.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:33.241 --> 07:35.206
- Woo! Woo! Woo! Woo!
- 哇！哇！哇！哇！

07:35.275 --> 07:36.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:36.896 --> 07:40.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:40.586 --> 07:43.517
[tinkling]
[叮当声]

07:43.586 --> 07:47.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:47.620 --> 07:49.344
We did a good job.
我们做得很好。

07:49.413 --> 07:51.689
Bikini Bottom
looks so clean now.
比基尼泳裤
现在看起来很干净。

07:51.758 --> 07:53.551
- Just one more house,
and I can finally
- 再多一栋房子，
我终于可以

07:53.620 --> 07:55.965
say goodbye
to this trash life.
说再见
过着这种垃圾生活。

07:56.034 --> 07:59.275
Let's get these in the truck
and get out of here.
让我们把这些装上卡车
然后离开这里。

07:59.344 --> 08:02.413
- Hey!
Get away from my stuff!
- 嘿！
远离我的东西！

08:02.482 --> 08:04.241
- Oh, this isn't stuff,
Patrick.
- 哦，这不是东西，
帕特里克.

08:04.310 --> 08:06.586
It's trash, and it needs to be
thrown into the trash truck.
是垃圾，必须处理
扔进垃圾车。

08:06.655 --> 08:08.172
- No, it's mine!
- 不，这是我的！

08:08.241 --> 08:10.068
[growls]
[咆哮]

08:10.137 --> 08:12.034
[barking]
[叫声]

08:12.103 --> 08:13.448
- Fetch!
- 拿来！

08:14.655 --> 08:17.896
- [garbled yelling]
- [乱码大喊]

08:20.413 --> 08:21.758
- Ooh, that looks fun!
- 哦，看起来很有趣！

08:21.827 --> 08:23.241
[barking]
- Forget about the stick,
[吠叫]
- 忘记棍子，

08:23.310 --> 08:25.896
and help me get these cans
in the truck.
帮我拿这些罐头
在卡车里。

08:25.965 --> 08:27.310
- Hm? Patooie!
- 嗯？帕图耶！

08:27.379 --> 08:29.310
You betrayed me, stick!
你背叛了我，棍子！

08:29.379 --> 08:32.172
[barking]
[叫声]

08:32.241 --> 08:33.275
- Let go!
- 松手！

08:33.344 --> 08:35.000
SpongeBob, help me!
海绵宝宝，帮帮我吧！

08:37.034 --> 08:38.275
[all straining]
[一切都紧张]

08:38.344 --> 08:40.896
Hold on, SpongeBob!
坚持住，海绵宝宝！

08:40.965 --> 08:43.793
[straining]
[紧张]

08:43.862 --> 08:44.586
- Oh!
- 哦！

08:44.655 --> 08:48.137
[machine whirring]
[机器呼呼地响]

08:48.206 --> 08:50.758
- Get your hand off my can!
- 把你的手从我的罐子上拿开！

08:50.827 --> 08:52.275
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:52.344 --> 08:54.068
[snap]
[crashing]
[啪]
[崩溃]

08:54.137 --> 08:55.827
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:57.620 --> 09:00.275
- Wow, Patrick.
You must be working out.
- 哇，帕特里克。
你一定在锻炼。

09:01.206 --> 09:03.517
- Yeah,
the gym membership you got me
- 是的，
你给我的健身房会员资格

09:03.586 --> 09:04.931
is really paying off.
确实得到了回报。

09:05.000 --> 09:06.758
- Stop consorting
with the enemy!
- 停止交往
与敌人同在！

09:06.827 --> 09:08.448
- Oh,
he's not an enemy, Squidward.
- 哦，
他不是敌人，章鱼哥。

09:08.517 --> 09:09.620
He's my best friend.
他是我最好的朋友。

09:09.689 --> 09:10.827
Besides you.
除了你之外。

09:10.896 --> 09:12.482
Muah.
- Ew.
么么哒。
- 呃。

09:12.551 --> 09:13.482
- You know, maybe we should
just let Patrick
- 你知道，也许我们应该
只要让帕特里克

09:13.551 --> 09:14.724
keep his garbage.
保留他的垃圾。

09:14.793 --> 09:16.482
- No. The trash inspector said
- 不，垃圾检查员说

09:16.551 --> 09:18.862
we had to collect
all the town's trash
我们必须收集
镇上所有的垃圾

09:18.931 --> 09:20.862
and that is what
we are going to do.
这就是
我们要做的。

09:20.931 --> 09:25.000
- Nobody touches my trash.
- 没有人碰我的垃圾。

09:25.068 --> 09:26.586
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:26.655 --> 09:29.000
- So,
that's how you wanna play it.
- 那么，
这就是你想要的玩法。

09:29.068 --> 09:32.689
It's time to take Patrick
to the dump.
是时候带帕特里克了
到垃圾场。

09:32.758 --> 09:35.724
- Ooh, Squidward,
you sound so tough.
- 哦，章鱼哥，
你听起来很强硬。

09:35.793 --> 09:38.344
- Engaging battle mode.
- 参与战斗模式。

09:38.413 --> 09:39.379
Hah!
哈！

09:39.448 --> 09:42.103
[robotic whirring]
[机器人呼呼声]

09:42.172 --> 09:45.103
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:45.172 --> 09:52.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:55.344 --> 09:56.793
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

09:56.862 --> 09:59.758
[whirring,
metal booming]
[呼呼，
金属蓬勃发展]

09:59.827 --> 10:01.793
- This is your last chance.
- 这是你最后的机会。

10:01.862 --> 10:03.620
Give us your garbage,
把你的垃圾交给我们，

10:03.689 --> 10:06.379
or you're the one
who'll be trashed!
或者你就是那个
谁会被垃圾！

10:06.448 --> 10:08.827
- Hah, o-oh yeah, well,
- 哈，哦，是的，好吧，

10:08.896 --> 10:11.310
you're j--uh--fight!
你在——呃——战斗！

10:11.379 --> 10:13.275
[battle cry]
[战斗呐喊]

10:13.344 --> 10:16.034
- [battle cry]
- [战斗呐喊]

10:16.103 --> 10:17.172
[metal crashing]
[金属碰撞]

10:17.241 --> 10:18.172
[gunk splattering]
[粘液飞溅]

10:18.241 --> 10:19.689
[crashing]
[崩溃]

10:19.758 --> 10:20.931
[splattering]
[飞溅]

10:21.000 --> 10:24.310
[SpongeBob and Squidward
yelling]
[海绵宝宝和章鱼哥
喊叫]

10:24.379 --> 10:27.275
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

10:27.344 --> 10:29.137
Ah.
啊。

10:29.206 --> 10:32.517
Picking up trash
sure is hard work.
捡垃圾
当然是艰苦的工作。

10:32.586 --> 10:33.620
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

10:33.689 --> 10:35.000
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

10:35.068 --> 10:36.344
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

10:36.413 --> 10:37.827
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

10:39.620 --> 10:43.551
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

10:43.620 --> 10:45.827
- Just give me your trash!
- 把你的垃圾给我吧！

10:45.896 --> 10:46.724
- No!
- 不！

10:46.793 --> 10:48.379
It's mine, and I love it!
这是我的，我喜欢它！

10:48.448 --> 10:49.896
- Give it!
- 给它！

10:49.965 --> 10:51.137
- Never!
- 绝不！

10:51.206 --> 10:53.241
[robotic whirring]
[机器人呼呼声]

10:53.310 --> 10:54.241
[explosion]
[爆炸]

10:54.310 --> 10:58.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:58.137 --> 10:59.655
- Knock it off!
- 关掉它！

10:59.724 --> 11:04.241
You ignoramuseses
are ruining all me hard work!
你们无知
毁了我所有的努力！

11:04.310 --> 11:05.724
all: What?
全体：什么？

11:05.793 --> 11:07.172
- Your hard work?
- 你的努力吗？

11:07.241 --> 11:09.862
I've been tentacle deep
in trash all day
我已经触手深深
整天在垃圾桶里

11:09.931 --> 11:11.310
and it's your fault!
这是你的错！

11:11.379 --> 11:13.517
[whirring]
[呼呼]

11:13.586 --> 11:15.586
[mischievous music]
[恶作剧的音乐]

11:15.655 --> 11:17.137
- [gags]
- [笑声]

11:17.206 --> 11:18.482
- Trash fight!
- 垃圾大战！

11:18.551 --> 11:21.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:21.310 --> 11:22.896
- [chewing]
- [咀嚼]

11:22.965 --> 11:24.034
Hey!
嘿！

11:24.103 --> 11:27.103
[screaming]
[尖叫]

11:29.137 --> 11:30.689
[sirens wailing]
[警笛哀嚎]

11:30.758 --> 11:33.275
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

11:33.344 --> 11:34.896
all: Uh-oh.
全体：呃哦。

11:36.620 --> 11:39.310
[mellow music]
[柔和的音乐]

11:39.379 --> 11:42.103
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

11:42.172 --> 11:43.172
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

11:43.241 --> 11:44.793
- Wanna pick that up?
- 想把它捡起来吗？

11:44.862 --> 11:48.448
[maniacal giggling]
[疯狂的咯咯笑]

11:48.517 --> 11:49.931
- I hate that doll.
- 我讨厌那个娃娃。

- 我讨厌那个娃娃。